From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YanIanZ <iwayanbagusaryadarma@student.telkomuniversity.ac.id>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:09:57 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft - BRAND_SOURBYCRAFT_ID replaces BRAND_CANVAS_ID

Breaking API change (owner decision 2026-10-21): the Canvas brand key is
removed without a shim; SourbyCraft's own key matches the jar's Brand-Id
sourbycraft:sourbycraft.

diff --git a/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/ServerBuildInfo.java b/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/ServerBuildInfo.java
index 4e9e4e40d31a323bf31aa3cb08ba10f94ebc053c..a3967d9275f370663c341c83db569e75cd77799a 100644
--- a/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/ServerBuildInfo.java
+++ b/src/main/java/io/papermc/paper/ServerBuildInfo.java
@@ -21,11 +21,13 @@ public interface ServerBuildInfo {
      * The brand id for Folia.
      */
     Key BRAND_FOLIA_ID = Key.key("papermc", "folia");
+    // Canvas end - Rebrand
+    // SourbyCraft start - brand id; BRAND_CANVAS_ID ("canvasmc:canvas") removed (owner decision 2026-10-21, no shim)
     /**
-     * The brand id for Canvas.
+     * The brand id for SourbyCraft, the {@code Brand-Id} of a SourbyCraft server jar.
      */
-    Key BRAND_CANVAS_ID = Key.key("canvasmc", "canvas");
-    // Canvas end - Rebrand
+    Key BRAND_SOURBYCRAFT_ID = Key.key("sourbycraft", "sourbycraft");
+    // SourbyCraft end - brand id
 
     /**
      * Gets the {@code ServerBuildInfo}.
